# SSH allowed-signers format: <principal> <options> <key-type> <public-key>
# See ALLOWED SIGNERS in ssh-keygen(1). One line per approver.
# Approver keys live on a FIDO2 security key (sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com), so every signature needs a touch
# (SPEC-001-R12). Touch only for now, per the owner decision of 2026-11-05: no PIN unless the key was created with
# -O verify-required (VERIFY_REQUIRED=1). scripts/bootstrap/rotate-approver-key.sh creates one.
approver@example.com namespaces="git" sk-ssh-ed25519@openssh.com AAAAGnNrLXNzaC1lZDI1NTE5QG9wZW5zc2guY29tEXAMPLEEXAMPLEEXAMPLE
